{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Triumvora is a <strong>Roguelite</strong> with <strong>Survival</strong> and <strong>Hack 'n Slash</strong> elements, set in a surreal world of plants and concrete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inside this infinite city, a new ecosystem has formed. Mysterious creatures have claimed the top of the food chain. Live through one's eyes and grow from a weakling to the city's ruler.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRY THE DEMO FOR FREE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and learn about Sector Zero - your previous home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creatures inhabiting Sector Zero are self-sufficient and (usually) peaceful. Interact with them for Aura as you take over each Block.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out 3 Attacks, each with 3 possible Passive Effects. Find an Attack Chain that suits your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retrieve 3 Crown Pieces of the same Aura to become Sector Zero's Ruler.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">~30 minutes of playtime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Note: The Demo does not support progress saving. See how far you can go in a single run!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762810/extras/h1.png?t=1749508425\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Food is limited and in high demand.</strong> Will you eat it, stash it for hard times, or share it? Will you protect your stockpiles or raid others\u2019? Maximise your resources in a limited time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762810/extras/h2.png?t=1749508425\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These strange beings are able to see and absorb Aura, concentrated sources of the universe\u2019s energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How will you assert your power?</strong> Through the wealth of your stockpiles, the number of loyal allies you've gathered, or pure aggression?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762810/extras/h3.png?t=1749508425\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be the Ruler that creates order from chaos. You will deal with the meek and the unruly, while gathering Aura for your Crown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death won't be the end of your rule. <strong>There's higher powers at play here</strong>, which can make good use of your hard-earned Aura.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LABOUR OF LOVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're a fan of unique Indie games, <strong>wishlist the full game</strong>! Triumvora is made by a solo developer (hi!) and I've put in a lot of love and care in every aspect of it, from the gameplay to the art.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762810?t=1749508425","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762810?t=1749508425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762810/d8e93bafda04fb2b9b1ac97dab5468cb2ddcef64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749508425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762810/d8e93bafda04fb2b9b1ac97dab5468cb2ddcef64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749508425","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Triumvora is a <strong>Roguelite</strong> with <strong>Survival</strong> and <strong>Hack 'n Slash</strong> elements, set in a surreal world of plants and concrete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inside this infinite city, a new ecosystem has formed. Mysterious creatures have cl